//! Compares Rust output against the recorded MATSim 2026.0 reference for the shared PT fixtures.
//!
//! The reference is generated by `java_reference/run_reference.sh` into
//! `tests/resources/pt_reference/java/`. The comparison rules and the known deviations they encode
//! are documented in `docs/pt_java_reference.md`.
//!
//! Nothing here re-implements MATSim. Both sides are observed through the boundaries the rest of the
//! test suite uses: the controller writes the events, and the router the controller built answers
//! routing requests.

